  "body": "## Breaking Changes \r\n*none*\r\n\r\n## New Features\r\n*none*\r\n\r\n## Fixes\r\n* Fix sort and aggregate results while a reindex enables a filter index by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13921\r\n* Let a replica movement replay writes stored without a class name by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13961\r\n* Fail over off a recovering replica on replicated reads and vector search by @jeroiraz in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13938\r\n* reindex: fix tenant and schema changes stalling during a large reindex (8.7 s to 58 µs at 1M tenants) by @etiennedi in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13872\r\n* Backport: fix(lsmkv): return an error for damaged RoaringSet WAL record lengths by @jfrancoa in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13945\r\n\r\n## Deprecations\r\n* Deprecate remaining classless endpoints by @dirkkul in https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/pull/13967\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/weaviate/weaviate/compare/v1.40.6...v1.40.7",
